OL,3,ABernie Sanders and Steve Bannon speak
OL,4,Aat summit calling for Congress to
OL,5,Aregulate AI industry
OL,6,
OL,7,FBernie Sanders, an independent senator,
OL,8,Fand Steve Bannon, a former Trump White
OL,9,FHouse adviser, are speaking at an event
OL,10,Fin Washington to push for faster action
OL,11,Fon AI regulations - watch live above
OL,13,FElsewhere, Donald Trump is downplaying
OL,14,FAI concerns as pressure mounts on the
OL,15,FUS Congress to rein in big tech
OL,16,Fcompanies
OL,18,FThe president says claims that AI will
OL,19,Ftake over the world are a "hoax" and
OL,20,Fhas criticised the head of Anthropic,
OL,21,Fwho is calling for a slowdown in AI
OL,22,Fdevelopment
