OL,3,ABernie Sanders and Steve Bannon speak
OL,4,Aat summit calling for Congress to
OL,5,Aregulate AI industry
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt all comes one day after an Anthropic
OL,8,Fexecutive told the BBC that AI is
OL,9,Fgetting more powerful "by the day" and
OL,10,Fa kill switch should be mandatory
OL,12,FLater today: Top AI bosses - including
OL,13,FOpenAI's Sam Altman and Anthropic's
OL,14,FDario Amodei - will speak publicly for
OL,15,Fthe first time since the slowdown
OL,16,Fdebate emerged this week
